contentText:
Dolly Parton is expressing her gratitude to Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce.

The country icon took to Instagram on Friday (July 3) to thank the pop superstar and Kansas City Chiefs tight end for their generous pre-wedding donation of $2 million to her Imagination Library, a literacy program that provides free books to children.

